/*!
    \page lua-types.html
    \title Lua API Types

    These are the engine and editor types exposed to Lua. QDoc labels them
    "QML types" because the original reference uses QML documentation commands;
    the scripting language is Lua.

    See the \l {Lua Wrapper API} for scripting concepts and the
    \l {ESToolkit User Manual} for editor instructions.

    This reference preserves the original documentation. Some signatures,
    platform descriptions and links may be out of date.

    \generatelist qmltypes
*/
